{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00445",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.16,
      "end_seconds": 4.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Hello? Doctor? They told me to come straight in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.73,
      "end_seconds": 9.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "You're fine, sit down. So, what brings you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 10.34,
      "end_seconds": 14.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor. I came along to help out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.42,
      "end_seconds": 20.81,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "I'm here because of sneezing fits. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.61,
      "end_seconds": 25.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "And when did that start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.28,
      "end_seconds": 33.96,
      "duration_seconds": 7.68,
      "text": "Since last night, that's when it began. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.52,
      "end_seconds": 38.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Right. Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.77,
      "end_seconds": 46.85,
      "duration_seconds": 7.08,
      "text": "It's all the time. It's severe, honestly. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.64,
      "end_seconds": 49.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "Have you had itchy watery eyes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.25,
      "end_seconds": 58.4,
      "duration_seconds": 8.15,
      "text": "Yes, about the same, six months. I had a blocked nose at night before. That's settled now, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.73,
      "end_seconds": 63.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.52,
      "end_seconds": 76.41,
      "duration_seconds": 11.89,
      "text": "For the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.76,
      "end_seconds": 82.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Have you had any rash, wheezing or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.75,
      "end_seconds": 86.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "No, no rash, wheezing or fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.88,
      "end_seconds": 90.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.99,
      "end_seconds": 92.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.05,
      "end_seconds": 97.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.69,
      "end_seconds": 98.39,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.41,
      "end_seconds": 113.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Does anything run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.37,
      "end_seconds": 116.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "My grandmother had breast cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.46,
      "end_seconds": 121.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.5,
      "end_seconds": 122.2,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.63,
      "end_seconds": 139.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.34,
      "end_seconds": 143.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Just a lump removed from my back, years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.51,
      "end_seconds": 160.19,
      "duration_seconds": 14.68,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.51,
      "end_seconds": 165.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Hmm, you know, I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.86,
      "end_seconds": 166.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.8,
      "end_seconds": 168.68,
      "duration_seconds": 0.88,
      "text": "Nothing, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.69,
      "end_seconds": 173.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.86,
      "end_seconds": 184.85,
      "duration_seconds": 10.99,
      "text": "Not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.97,
      "end_seconds": 191.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.01,
      "end_seconds": 194.87,
      "duration_seconds": 0.86,
      "text": "Yes, eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.46,
      "end_seconds": 199.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known eczema. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.51,
      "end_seconds": 203.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "I'm just saving what we've covered so far."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.63,
      "end_seconds": 216.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Good, where were we. How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.64,
      "end_seconds": 219.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "I smoke, yes, around five a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.47,
      "end_seconds": 235.2,
      "duration_seconds": 13.73,
      "text": "I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.27,
      "end_seconds": 237.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.66,
      "end_seconds": 242.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.06,
      "end_seconds": 246.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "I'm allergic to codeine, I get feeling very drowsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.81,
      "end_seconds": 262.23,
      "duration_seconds": 14.42,
      "text": "I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.25,
      "end_seconds": 265.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.58,
      "end_seconds": 268.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.01,
      "end_seconds": 282.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "So, just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.77,
      "end_seconds": 306.88,
      "duration_seconds": 8.11,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 98 percent on room air, respiratory rate 14. And pulse is 82 beats a minute, pressure 113 over 74."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.85,
      "end_seconds": 309.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.78,
      "end_seconds": 315.66,
      "duration_seconds": 5.88,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment. Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.47,
      "end_seconds": 317.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "No, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.33,
      "end_seconds": 320.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.93,
      "end_seconds": 327.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.1,
      "end_seconds": 339.69,
      "duration_seconds": 11.59,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. My working impression is allergic rhinitis. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. I can't rule out a viral cold yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.21,
      "end_seconds": 343.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Should I be worried about this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.51,
      "end_seconds": 360.53,
      "duration_seconds": 16.02,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like allergic rhinitis, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had sneezing fits, since last night, severe, and no fever or wheezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 363.52,
      "end_seconds": 365.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 366.75,
      "end_seconds": 369.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 370.13,
      "end_seconds": 370.98,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 379.43,
      "end_seconds": 401.98,
      "duration_seconds": 22.55,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. I'm going to order an allergy test, for allergic rhinitis. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. I'll start you on fluticasone nasal spray, 50 micrograms, one spray each side daily, for four weeks. That's for allergic rhinitis. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 403.02,
      "end_seconds": 404.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "Right, I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 405.62,
      "end_seconds": 428.74,
      "duration_seconds": 23.12,
      "text": "I'd like you to take levocetirizine, 5 milligrams, at night, for two weeks. That's for allergy symptoms. Keep the windows closed in the early morning and wash the bedsheets weekly in hot water. Please take the tablets with food so they don't upset your stomach. Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently. Let's review you in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 429.2,
      "end_seconds": 430.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 431.85,
      "end_seconds": 439.03,
      "duration_seconds": 7.18,
      "text": "Just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 439.35,
      "end_seconds": 450.6,
      "duration_seconds": 11.25,
      "text": "So, I take the fluticasone nasal spray, 50 micrograms, one spray each side daily and take the levocetirizine, 5 milligrams, at night. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 451.04,
      "end_seconds": 455.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Good. Call the clinic if you need us in the meantime."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 456.22,
      "end_seconds": 458.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Thanks so much, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 458.51,
      "end_seconds": 460.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Bye for now, look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}